{"s":"EKGYO.IS","upd":"2026-11-13T14:32:32Z","profile":{"longName":"Emlak Konut Gayrimenkul Yatirim Ortakligi A.S.","shortName":"EMLAK KONUT GMYO","sector":"Real Estate","sectorDisp":"Real Estate","industry":"REIT - Residential","industryDisp":"REIT - Residential","country":"Turkey","city":"Atasehir","website":"https://www.emlakkonut.com.tr","fullTimeEmployees":1461,"longBusinessSummary":"Emlak Konut Gayrimenkul Yatirim Ortakligi A.S., a long-established brand in the construction sector, began. Establishing environmentally friendly, modern cities that would add comfort to human life was determined as a corporate vision. With this basic purpose, Emlak Konut became the architect of many innovative applications in its sector. Emlak Konut carried out projects that set an example and left a mark in the planned urbanization of our country. It built the most innovative cities of its time, large enough to give its name to the district it was located in. This stable growth brought with it a serious turning point and in 2002, Emlak Konut became a real estate investment partnership. This transformation was the harbinger of giant projects, groundbreaking initiatives and becoming a bigger company. With becoming a Real Estate Investment Partnership, Emlak Konut was behind projects that resonated around the world in the field of design, included environmentally friendly technologies and added value to the city. Since 2003, it has tendered a total of 388 projects of various sizes, and because of the completion of these projects, it will have ensured the construction of 251,000 independent units. Emlak Konut went public twice with a breakthrough that would crown its rapid growth and carry its goals to broader horizons. The first offering in 2010 became one of the 5 largest public offerings in the history of the Republic. The secondary offering in 2013 was the largest public offering in the real estate sector in Europe in the last 5 years. Growing with the public offerings, Emlak Konut has further consolidated its place among the strongest companies in Turkey with its paid-in capital of 3.8 billion liras and total assets of 205 billion liras as of the end of 2024. Emlak Konut Gayrimenkul Yatirim Ortakligi A.S. was incorporated in 1953 in Turkey.","quoteType":"EQUITY","exchange":"IST","fullExchangeName":"Istanbul","currency":"TRY","financialCurrency":"TRY","firstTradeDateMilliseconds":1291275000000},"stats":{"marketCap":68060225536,"enterpriseValue":124327591936,"forwardPE":929.5,"pegRatio":0.06,"priceToBook":0.5400616,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":0.7093071,"enterpriseToRevenue":1.296,"enterpriseToEbitda":4.114,"profitMargins":-0.03946,"grossMargins":0.27482998,"operatingMargins":0.30974,"ebitdaMargins":0.31498,"returnOnEquity":-0.02607,"returnOnAssets":0.046880003,"revenueGrowth":0.22,"earningsQuarterlyGrowth":0.956,"totalRevenue":95953117184,"grossProfits":26370480128,"ebitda":30223255552,"netIncomeToCommon":-3786406912,"operatingCashflow":1770162944,"freeCashflow":-76327976960,"totalCash":53406539776,"totalCashPerShare":14.173,"totalDebt":106855268352,"debtToEquity":66.099,"currentRatio":1.943,"quickRatio":0.484,"bookValue":34.422,"revenuePerShare":26.302,"trailingEps":-2.45,"forwardEps":0.02,"epsTrailingTwelveMonths":-2.45,"dividendRate":0.6,"dividendYield":3.19,"payoutRatio":2.5294,"exDividendDate":1782259200,"lastDividendValue":0.6,"lastDividendDate":1782259200,"trailingAnnualDividendRate":0.0,"trailingAnnualDividendYield":0.0,"fiveYearAvgDividendYield":1.95,"sharesOutstanding":3661120138,"floatShares":1657721333,"impliedSharesOutstanding":3661120139,"heldPercentInsiders":0.49338,"heldPercentInstitutions":0.05528,"targetMeanPrice":32.93,"targetHighPrice":33.15,"targetLowPrice":32.8,"targetMedianPrice":32.84,"recommendationKey":"strong_buy","recommendationMean":1.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":3,"averageAnalystRating":"1.0 - Strong Buy","fiftyTwoWeekHigh":27.12,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":15.74,"fiftyDayAverage":18.8724,"twoHundredDayAverage":20.3233,